# API keys for the live probe (scripts/probe.mjs).
#
# The probe reads each provider's `env_key` from the environment and tests only
# the providers whose key is present — any subset works, missing keys are simply
# skipped. Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in the keys you have.
# Never commit `.env`.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   node --env-file=.env scripts/probe.mjs --write               # full: /models + 1-token call -> `live`
#   node --env-file=.env scripts/probe.mjs --write --auth-only   # credentials only -> `auth-ok`
#   npm run build && npm test                                    # regenerate + validate
#
# Recommended first five (no credit card required):
#   OpenRouter           https://openrouter.ai/keys        (free ":free" models)
#   Cloudflare Workers AI https://dash.cloudflare.com       (10,000 neurons/day)
#   SambaNova Cloud      https://cloud.sambanova.ai         (rate-limited free tier)
#   Groq                 https://console.groq.com/keys      (phone verification at signup)
#   Scaleway             https://console.scaleway.com        (1M free tokens, EU)
#
# (Cerebras is omitted: its free tier is now a card-gated $5 / 30-day trial.)

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
SCALEWAY_API_KEY=
